From a6b2dc82206891bb17c53a7610a59b6dc7b78a50 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Philip Skinner <philip.skinner@cds.co.uk>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2020 08:19:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [*] Swaps over implementation to using spawn instead of exec.

This is to protect against a injection vulnerability that
was identified by Alessio (d3lla).

Many thanks to Alessio for finding this and bringing it to
my attention.

A unit test that covers a specific example of this attack has
been added into the project to ensure that it errors instead
of executing the injected code.
---
